    "description": "Christmas dream destination in Europe 🎄\n\nThis European Christmas city feels straight out of a fairytale 😍 It’s like walking through a storybook! I kept stopping every few steps because every single corner looked like a postcard. \n\nEverywhere you look there are fairy lights and festive treats. I was basically running on waffles and hot chocolate the whole time and not mad about it 😆\n\nThe Bruges Christmas markets are so cute and at night the Winter Glow light trail lights up the city. Honestly, it just feels like Christmas here ✨\n\nIf you’re planning a festive trip in Europe, this place needs to be on your list 🎄\n\n📍 Brugge, Belgium\n\n©️ NO reposts. DM for licensing.\n\n#bruges Europe’s most festive cities #brugge most magical Christmas town in Europe #christmasineurope best Christmas holiday destination #uktravelblogger best European Christmas city breaks #christmasmarkets most beautiful Christmas places in Europe #visitbelgium European christmas holiday ideas #visitbruges best Christmas markets in Europe #winterineurope",
